{
  "meta": {
    "version": 3,
    "updatedBy": "copilot",
    "note": "Windows Fluent UI for OpenClaw — ported from the v1 raw-CSS components.jsonc to v3 Auto Layout. WinUI-derived pixel padding is snapped to the nearest 4px spacing token; per-component notes record the source values and any approximation."
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Button",
      "note": "Primary action. One per view — it's where the eye should land. Padding mirrors WinUI's default ButtonPadding (11,5,11,6), snapped to spacing tokens 3 (12≈11) and 1 (4≈5/6). In-app MinWidth 100px keeps short labels (OK / Connect) from cramping and gives side-by-side buttons a consistent footprint; that minimum has no spacing-token equivalent, so it stays a port note and the preview hugs its label.",
      "props": {
        "children": "Save changes",
        "variant": "primary"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "button-root",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "ds-btn ds-btn-{variant}",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "horizontal",
          "padding": {
            "x": "3",
            "y": "1"
          },
          "align": "center",
          "justify": "center",
          "width": "hug"
        },
        "children": [
          "{children}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Field",
      "note": "Text input with a quiet label above it — the field is the subject. Input padding mirrors WinUI TextControlThemePadding (10,5,6,6), snapped to tokens 2 (8≈10/6 horizontal) and 1 (4≈5/6 vertical). In-app MinHeight 32px lines a field up with a Button on the same row; that minimum stays a port note.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Gateway address",
        "placeholder": "127.0.0.1:18789"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "field-root",
        "el": "label",
        "class": "ds-field",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "gap": "2",
          "width": "fill"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "field-label",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "ds-field-label",
            "children": [
              "{label}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "field-input",
            "el": "input",
            "class": "ds-input",
            "attrs": {
              "placeholder": "{placeholder}"
            },
            "layout": {
              "padding": {
                "x": "2",
                "y": "1"
              },
              "width": "fill"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "note": "Content card. Flat by default — a 1px hairline border, not a drop shadow. Padding mirrors the WinUI Gallery card (16,12) as tokens 4 (16) and 3 (12) exactly, with the `md` radius and a `line`-colored border supplied by the ds-card class. Never nest a card inside a card.",
      "props": {
        "title": "Windows node",
        "body": "Paired · 6 capabilities exposed over MCP."
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "card-root",
        "el": "article",
        "class": "ds-card",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "gap": "2",
          "padding": {
            "x": "4",
            "y": "3"
          },
          "width": "fill"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "card-title",
            "el": "h3",
            "class": "ds-card-title",
            "children": [
              "{title}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "card-body",
            "el": "p",
            "class": "ds-card-body",
            "children": [
              "{body}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "card-link",
            "el": "a",
            "class": "ds-link",
            "attrs": {
              "href": "#"
            },
            "margin": {
              "top": "1"
            },
            "children": [
              "Open report →"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Badge",
      "note": "Status pill. Uses semantic color tokens, never a raw hex. Padding tokens 3/1 give the pill a compact footprint; the `pill` radius and tone color come from the ds-badge class.",
      "props": {
        "children": "Connected",
        "tone": "positive"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "badge-root",
        "el": "span",
        "class": "ds-badge ds-badge-{tone}",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "horizontal",
          "padding": {
            "x": "3",
            "y": "1"
          },
          "align": "center",
          "width": "hug"
        },
        "children": [
          "{children}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ComposerPicker",
      "note": "Subtle inline dropdown. A borderless, transparent picker showing the current value in `muted` secondary text with a trailing `muted` chevron (Segoe Fluent \\uE70D, previewed ~10px). 32px min height; horizontal padding token `2`, gap token `1`. Resting fill is transparent (SubtleFillColorTransparent); hover uses `subtleHover` (SubtleFillColorSecondary) and press uses `subtlePressed` (SubtleFillColorTertiary), so the picker stays quiet in the composer toolbar and never competes with the primary Send action. When there is nothing to choose (for example the session picker with a single session) the picker is disabled and its value reads a shade lighter than the enabled muted text. Used for the model, reasoning-effort, and session selectors; opens a flyout list of single-select (RadioMenuItem) options in-app. The chevron carries a small right/up offset (previewed 2,4,0,0) to sit tight against the value; the flyout list is a Reactor port note.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Model"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "composer-picker-root",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "ds-btn",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "role": "combobox",
          "aria-haspopup": "listbox",
          "aria-label": "{label}"
        },
        "layout": {
          "mode": "horizontal",
          "gap": "1",
          "padding": {
            "left": "2",
            "right": "2"
          },
          "align": "center",
          "height": 32,
          "width": "hug"
        },
        "appearance": {
          "fontFamily": "body",
          "textStyle": "small",
          "color": "muted",
          "radius": "sm"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "composer-picker-label",
            "el": "span",
            "children": [
              "{label}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "composer-picker-chevron",
            "el": "svg",
            "attrs": {
              "width": "12",
              "height": "12",
              "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
              "fill": "none",
              "aria-hidden": "true",
              "stroke": "currentColor",
              "stroke-width": "2",
              "stroke-linecap": "round",
              "stroke-linejoin": "round"
            },
            "appearance": {
              "color": "muted"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "composer-picker-chevron-path",
                "el": "path",
                "attrs": {
                  "d": "M6 9l6 6 6-6"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ChatBubble",
      "note": "Assistant chat bubble: a 36×36 avatar (subtle `surface` fill, hairline `controlLine` border, `pill` radius) to the LEFT of a bubble on a `subtleHover` fill with a `controlLine` border. The `bubble` radius (16px) is friendlier than the 8/12px control radii; padding tokens 4/3 mirror the app's 16/12. Footer reads timestamp · usage · Copy · Read aloud — Copy and Read aloud are hover-gated 20×20 subtle icon buttons in-app, and usage is the used/context (pct%) string ChatUsageFormatter produces. Mirrors ReactorChatTimeline's assistant row; ships via Reactor. Bubble max-width min(80%, 720px) and the run-start avatar gating are Reactor port notes (no token equivalent). (User messages ride the softer `accentSubtle` on the right in-app; this previews the assistant variant.)",
      "props": {
        "time": "2:14 PM",
        "usage": "12.5K/200K (6%)",
        "children": "Paired to the gateway — 6 Windows node capabilities are live."
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "chat-bubble-root",
        "el": "div",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "horizontal",
          "gap": "2",
          "align": "start"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "chat-bubble-avatar",
            "el": "div",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "layout": {
              "mode": "horizontal",
              "align": "center",
              "justify": "center",
              "width": 36,
              "height": 36
            },
            "appearance": {
              "background": "surface",
              "borderColor": "controlLine",
              "color": "muted",
              "radius": "pill"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "chat-bubble-avatar-glyph",
                "el": "svg",
                "attrs": {
                  "width": "18",
                  "height": "18",
                  "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
                  "fill": "currentColor",
                  "aria-hidden": "true"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "chat-bubble-avatar-path",
                    "el": "path",
                    "attrs": {
                      "d": "M12 2.5l1.7 5.1a4 4 0 0 0 2.7 2.7l5.1 1.7-5.1 1.7a4 4 0 0 0-2.7 2.7L12 21.5l-1.7-5.1a4 4 0 0 0-2.7-2.7L2.5 12l5.1-1.7a4 4 0 0 0 2.7-2.7L12 2.5z"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "chat-bubble-stack",
            "el": "div",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "vertical",
              "gap": "1",
              "align": "start"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "chat-bubble-message",
                "el": "div",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "vertical",
                  "padding": {
                    "x": "4",
                    "y": "3"
                  }
                },
                "appearance": {
                  "fontFamily": "body",
                  "textStyle": "body",
                  "background": "subtleHover",
                  "color": "ink",
                  "borderColor": "controlLine",
                  "radius": "bubble"
                },
                "children": [
                  "{children}"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "chat-bubble-footer",
                "el": "div",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "horizontal",
                  "gap": "2",
                  "padding": {
                    "x": "2"
                  },
                  "align": "center"
                },
                "appearance": {
                  "fontFamily": "body",
                  "textStyle": "caption",
                  "color": "muted"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "chat-bubble-time",
                    "el": "span",
                    "children": [
                      "{time}"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-bubble-dot",
                    "el": "span",
                    "attrs": {
                      "aria-hidden": "true"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      "·"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-bubble-usage",
                    "el": "span",
                    "children": [
                      "{usage}"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-bubble-copy",
                    "el": "button",
                    "class": "ds-btn",
                    "attrs": {
                      "type": "button",
                      "title": "Copy",
                      "aria-label": "Copy message"
                    },
                    "layout": {
                      "mode": "horizontal",
                      "align": "center",
                      "justify": "center",
                      "width": 20,
                      "height": 20
                    },
                    "appearance": {
                      "color": "muted",
                      "radius": "sm"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "chat-bubble-copy-glyph",
                        "el": "svg",
                        "attrs": {
                          "width": "14",
                          "height": "14",
                          "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
                          "fill": "none",
                          "aria-hidden": "true",
                          "stroke": "currentColor",
                          "stroke-width": "2",
                          "stroke-linecap": "round",
                          "stroke-linejoin": "round"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "chat-bubble-copy-rect",
                            "el": "rect",
                            "attrs": {
                              "x": "9",
                              "y": "9",
                              "width": "11",
                              "height": "11",
                              "rx": "2"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "chat-bubble-copy-path",
                            "el": "path",
                            "attrs": {
                              "d": "M6 15H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-bubble-readaloud",
                    "el": "button",
                    "class": "ds-btn",
                    "attrs": {
                      "type": "button",
                      "title": "Read aloud",
                      "aria-label": "Read message aloud"
                    },
                    "layout": {
                      "mode": "horizontal",
                      "align": "center",
                      "justify": "center",
                      "width": 20,
                      "height": 20
                    },
                    "appearance": {
                      "color": "muted",
                      "radius": "sm"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "chat-bubble-readaloud-glyph",
                        "el": "svg",
                        "attrs": {
                          "width": "14",
                          "height": "14",
                          "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
                          "fill": "none",
                          "aria-hidden": "true",
                          "stroke": "currentColor",
                          "stroke-width": "2",
                          "stroke-linecap": "round",
                          "stroke-linejoin": "round"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "chat-bubble-readaloud-poly",
                            "el": "polygon",
                            "attrs": {
                              "points": "11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "chat-bubble-readaloud-path",
                            "el": "path",
                            "attrs": {
                              "d": "M15.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 0 7M19 5a9 9 0 0 1 0 14"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ChatComposer",
      "note": "Chat input. A rounded `control` panel (`md` radius) with a hairline `controlLine` border wrapping a borderless, transparent, auto-growing textarea over a toolbar. Left cluster = Add, session picker, model picker, reasoning-effort picker; right cluster = Dictate (mic), Speaker, Settings, and the primary Send. Only Send spends the accent (it swaps to a subtle Stop while a turn is active, and reads disabled/greyed until the textarea has content); every other control stays subtle so the toolbar reads as quiet chrome. Each picker (see ComposerPicker) is a subtle borderless dropdown with muted value text; a picker with nothing to choose (for example the session picker when only one session exists) renders disabled, so its label reads a shade lighter than its enabled neighbours, as with `Main session` in the preview. Textarea min 56 / max 200px growth and the 12px outer margin are Reactor port notes; the app tightens top padding to 2px below token 1. (Preview shows the rest state with the placeholder visible.)",
      "props": {
        "placeholder": "Message Assistant (Enter to send)",
        "session": "Main session",
        "model": "Claude Sonnet 5",
        "effort": "Default"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "chat-composer-root",
        "el": "div",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "gap": "2",
          "padding": "2",
          "width": "fill"
        },
        "margin": "3",
        "appearance": {
          "background": "control",
          "borderColor": "controlLine",
          "radius": "md"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "chat-composer-input",
            "el": "textarea",
            "attrs": {
              "rows": "2",
              "placeholder": "{placeholder}"
            },
            "layout": {
              "padding": "2",
              "width": "fill"
            },
            "appearance": {
              "fontFamily": "body",
              "textStyle": "body",
              "color": "ink"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "chat-composer-toolbar",
            "el": "div",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "horizontal",
              "gap": "2",
              "align": "center",
              "justify": "space-between",
              "width": "fill"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "chat-composer-left",
                "el": "div",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "horizontal",
                  "gap": "2",
                  "align": "center"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "chat-composer-add",
                    "el": "button",
                    "class": "ds-btn",
                    "attrs": {
                      "type": "button",
                      "title": "Add context",
                      "aria-label": "Add context"
                    },
                    "layout": {
                      "mode": "horizontal",
                      "align": "center",
                      "justify": "center",
                      "width": 32,
                      "height": 32
                    },
                    "appearance": {
                      "color": "muted",
                      "radius": "sm"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "chat-composer-add-glyph",
                        "el": "svg",
                        "attrs": {
                          "width": "18",
                          "height": "18",
                          "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
                          "fill": "none",
                          "aria-hidden": "true",
                          "stroke": "currentColor",
                          "stroke-width": "2",
                          "stroke-linecap": "round",
                          "stroke-linejoin": "round"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "chat-composer-add-path",
                            "el": "path",
                            "attrs": {
                              "d": "M12 5v14M5 12h14"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-composer-session",
                    "component": "ComposerPicker",
                    "props": {
                      "label": "{session}"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-composer-model",
                    "component": "ComposerPicker",
                    "props": {
                      "label": "{model}"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "chat-composer-effort",
                    "component": "ComposerPicker",
                    "props": {
                      "label": "{effort}"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "chat-composer-right",
                "el": "div",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "horizontal",
                  "gap": "2",
                  "align": "center"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "chat-composer-mic",
                    "el": "button",
                    "class": "ds-btn",
                    "attrs": {
                      "type": "button",
                      "title": "Dictate",
                      "aria-label": "Dictate"
                    },
                    "layout": {
                      "mode": "horizontal",
                      "align": "center",
                      "justify": "center",
                      "width": 32,
                      "height": 32
                    },
                    "appearance": {
                      "color": "muted",
                      "radius": "sm"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "chat-composer-mic-glyph",
                        "el": "svg",
                        "attrs": {
                          "width": "18",
                          "height": "18",
                          "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
                          "fill": "none",
                          "aria-hidden": "true",
                          "stroke": "currentColor",
                          "stroke-width": "2",
                          "stroke-linecap": "round",
                          "stroke-linejoin": "round"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "chat-composer-mic-rect",
